# One line-ending rule for the whole repo: text files are stored and checked out with LF, on every platform.
# Before 2026-10-29 the tree was mixed (209 files carried CRLF) and three lanes that night rewrote whole files by
# accident just by saving them on Windows. `git add --renormalize .` applied this once; from here git keeps it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.onnx binary
*.wav binary
*.m4a binary
*.mp3 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.bin binary
